WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.455
Open the Service Queue.

2
00:00:03.555 --> 00:00:07.396
Tap the kart that needs a service.

3
00:00:07.496 --> 00:00:10.543
Tap Start service.

4
00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:16.143
Tap each check to mark it Good.

5
00:00:22.443 --> 00:00:27.943
Type the readings where asked.

6
00:00:52.016 --> 00:00:57.516
Add any part you fitted.

7
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:08.210
Tap Complete service.

8
00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:13.810
Tick the declaration and confirm.

9
00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:20.060
The kart is Ready again.
